      "writtenOn": "2026-09-14T11:50:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Lastly, the _configuration_ should be on a per-project basis, because I may have some open-source projects that do not bother being SPAMmed, but I would like to disable it by default on All-Projects.\n\nSo it should be on the `project.config` and should respect hierarchy.\n\nIn a nutshell, something really _similar_ to an ACL ;-)",
      "parentUuid": "ba361cc0_ac40a5ad",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 18,
